{"parentUuid":"56040b10-8ee7-4057-ac95-e3f91fb36923","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01XGi9sKQnmQWH1YoKiyCdmv","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"281b49f5-e448-473e-b5ab-fbe024114055","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:05:20.233Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"parentUuid":"281b49f5-e448-473e-b5ab-fbe024114055","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQW6U6cDRPKDPHtAaefb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Loading remote images from the CDN should behave identically between base and branch, though network timing could introduce minor pixel diffs. I'm checking which items have different content types to test—Article with an image, a plain Image item, and a Post with a social embed like an X/Twitter widget that loads an external script, which could affect preview rendering.\n\nI need a script to locate each card by its library item id, scrolling the virtualized grid container if the card isn't mounted yet, then opening it via focus plus Enter key rather than a raw click to avoid hitting nested controls like a video play button. After opening, I should wait for the expand animation to finish by checking the overlay's \"placed\" state versus the \"flying\" transition class.\n\nFor detecting settle, I'll watch for the close button gaining focus (which signals flight completion) and then confirm via getAnimations that CSS transitions have calmed, ignoring the mascot's infinite looping animation. Each item type needs its own set of captures: the image item needs Similar tab, zoom-in, and Move to Space shots; the note needs edit views at both desktop and narrow widths plus a focus mode toggle; the PDF needs its viewer shot. Between items I'll close with Escape and wait before moving to the next.\n\nNow I need to check the seed data for the PDF's fileUrl and find the note editor's focus-mode button label.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1487,"cache_read_input_tokens":183156,"output_tokens":1114,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":930},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standar