44","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:28:58.410Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"parentUuid":"716dbd38-2776-4057-b6bd-d300318dcf44","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QrnCCv96dTBDtzWze1G6Wz","type":"tool_result","content":"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\nhttps://entire.com/gh/squidys-tools/-/trails/165/changes/inkling/139\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\n\nLinear: [SQU-130](https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-130/stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive)\n\nStacked on #179 (SQU-129). Part of the SQU-124 UI refactor.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe Settings sheet and Archive lived inline in `App.tsx`, with about 640 lines of hand-written CSS in `App.css` plus `OpenSourceLicenses.css`. The section rail and the license filter were custom widgets with their own keyboard handling.\n\n## Fix\n\n- `src/features/settings/` now holds `SettingsSheet`, `SettingsPanel` (shared panel, header, row, empty state, pill buttons), `ArchivePanel`, `LibraryPanel`, `ExtensionPairing`, and the moved `ArchiveGrid`, `OpenSourceLicenses` and `LicenseFilter`. `App.tsx` drops from 1435 to 794 lines.\n- The section rail is Base UI `Tabs`, vertical, activating on focus. It renders through `motion.section`, so the dialog's DOM and animation are unchanged.\n- The license filter is a Base UI `Menu` with checkbox items. It is portalled inside the sheet, so the sheet's Tab trap and stacking still hold. Its item and popup styles are shared with the card context menu through `src/ui/Menu.tsx`.\n- Everything is restyled with Tailwind. The Settings and Archive blocks of `App.css` and `OpenSourceLicenses.css` are deleted. The archive tile styles move onto `LibraryCard`'s archive variant.\n- Archive windowing (`archiveGridWindow`) is untouched apart from the move. Its test only changed path.\n\n### Intentional differences (keyboard and a11y only)\n\n- The rail is now one Tab stop with Up/Down/Home/End, per the WAI tabs pattern. Before, every section was its own Tab stop. To support this, `keepTabFocusInside` now skips `tabIndex < 0` elements.\n- The dialog's `aria-labelledby` now points at the rail's \"Settings\" heading. Before, it pointed at an id that did not exist.\n- No `Switch` primitive was added: Settings has no on/off controls, so there was nothing to put it on.\n\n## Hit every surface\n\n- **Entry points:** Settings button, and the Archive reached from Settings. Escape and backdrop close the sheet, and focus returns to the Settings button.\n- **Card types:** archive tiles go through the shared `LibraryCard` archive variant for every kind.\n- **Reverse states:** archive restore, select, batch restore and batch delete (with undo) all verified. Licenses has a back button to General.\n- **App modes:**\n  - Preview (CSS fallback): checked against base with style dumps and pixel diffs at 1280×800 and 640px.\n  - Full app (liquid glass): checked with verify-inkling.\n- **Capture and search paths:** not touched.\n- **Docs:** `verify-inkling/features/archive-restore.md` and `scripts/ui-smoke.mjs` selectors are updated for the tabs. There is no changelog entry, because SQU-132 owns the stack's entry.\n\n## Verification\n\n- **Full app (verify-inkling, scratch library):**\n  - Seeded 4 notes and archived 3 through the card menu.\n  - Settings opens on General and shows `inkling 0.1.0`.\n  - Library shows the cached size at once.\n  - Extension shows \"Listening on 127.0.0.1:…\".\n  - Restoring one tile moves it back to the library; the DB shows `archived` 1 → 0.\n  - Select one, then Delete: the tile goes away and selection mode exits. After the undo window, the DB row is gone.\n  - Escape closes the sheet and returns focus to Settings, and reopening lands on General.\n- **Keyboard:**\n  - The tab rail handles arrows, Home and End with wrap.\n  - The Tab trap wraps both ways.\n  - The license filter opens on the first item from both pointer and Enter. Escape and Tab close only the menu and return to its trigger; Settings stays open.\n- **Pixel diff, base vs branch, full app:** every Settings state differs in fewer than 0.05% of channels. The only changed regions are the animated mascot and the random extension port.\n- **`bun run check` parts:** green except the known local Windows-only failures (CRLF `.d.mts` formatting, the data-dir precedence test).\n- `bun run ui:smoke` fails at step 1 (a seeded card is not mounted in the virtualized grid) identically on base, so its Settings step is skipped on both. This is tracked as an SQU-124 follow-up.\n- Export, import and copy still go through the same main-process picker calls (SQU-120 code is untouched). The native dialog can't be driven over CDP.\n\n## Before / after (full app)\n\n![Settings before and after](https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ130-settings-before-after.png)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0fd7d86e-c3b1-4492-966c-3216ad06a0cb","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:28:59.555Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\nhttps://entire.com/gh/squidys-tools/-/trails/165/changes/inkling/139\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\n\nLinear: [SQU-130](https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-130/stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive)\n\nStacked on #179 (SQU-129). Part of the SQU-124 UI refactor.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe Settings sheet and Archive lived inline in `App.tsx`, with about 640 lines of hand-written CSS in `App.css` plus `OpenSourceLicenses.css`. The section rail and the license filter were custom widgets with their own keyboard handling.\n\n## Fix\n\n- `src/features/settings/` now holds `SettingsSheet`, `SettingsPanel` (shared panel, header, row, empty state, pill buttons), `ArchivePanel`, `LibraryPanel`, `ExtensionPairing`, and the moved `ArchiveGrid`, `OpenSourceLicenses` and `LicenseFilter`. `App.tsx` drops from 1435 to 794 lines.\n- The section rail is Base UI `Tabs`, vertical, activating on focus. It renders through `motion.section`, so the dialog's DOM and animation are unchanged.\n- The license filter is a Base UI `Menu` with checkbox items. It is portalled inside the sheet, so the sheet's Tab trap and stacking still hold. Its item and popup styles are shared with the card context menu through `src/ui/Menu.tsx`.\n- Everything is restyled with Tailwind. The Settings and Archive blocks of `App.css` and `OpenSourceLicenses.css` are deleted. The archive tile styles move onto `LibraryCard`'s archive variant.\n- Archive windowing (`archiveGridWindow`) is untouched apart from the move. Its test only changed path.\n\n### Intentional differences (keyboard and a11y only)\n\n- The rail is now one Tab stop with Up/Down/Home/End, per the WAI tabs pattern. Before, every section was its own Tab stop. To support this, `keepTabFocusInside` now skips `tabIndex < 0` elements.\n- The dialog's `aria-labelledby` now points at the rail's \"Settings\" heading. Before, it pointed at an id that did not exist.\n- No `Switch` primitive was added: Settings has no on/off controls, so there was nothing to put it on.\n\n## Hit every surface\n\n- **Entry points:** Settings button, and the Archive reached from Settings. Escape and backdrop close the sheet, and focus returns to the Settings button.\n- **Card types:** archive tiles go through the shared `LibraryCard` archive variant for every kind.\n- **Reverse states:** archive restore, select, batch restore and batch delete (with undo) all verified. Licenses has a back button to General.\n- **App modes:**\n  - Preview (CSS fallback): checked against base with style dumps and pixel diffs at 1280×800 and 640px.\n  - Full app (liquid glass): checked with verify-inkling.\n- **Capture and search paths:** not touched.\n- **Docs:** `verify-inkling/features/archive-restore.md` and `scripts/ui-smoke.mjs` selectors are updated for the tabs. There is no changelog entry, because SQU-132 owns the stack's entry.\n\n## Verification\n\n- **Full app (verify-inkling, scratch library):**\n  - Seeded 4 notes and archived 3 through the card menu.\n  - Settings opens on General and shows `inkling 0.1.0`.\n  - Library shows the cached size at once.\n  - Extension shows \"Listening on 127.0.0.1:…\".\n  - Restoring one tile moves it back to the library; the DB shows `archived` 1 → 0.\n  - Select one, then Delete: the tile goes away and selection mode exits. After the undo window, the DB row is gone.\n  - Escape closes the sheet and returns focus to Settings, and reopening lands on General.\n- **Keyboard:**\n  - The tab rail handles arrows, Home and End with wrap.\n  - The Tab trap wraps both ways.\n  - The license filter opens on the first item from both pointer and Enter. Escape and Tab close only the menu and return to its trigger; Settings stays open.\n- **Pixel diff, base vs branch, full app:** every Settings state differs in fewer than 0.05% of channels. The only changed regions are the animated mascot and the random extension port.\n- **`bun run check` parts:** green except the known local Windows-only failures (CRLF `.d.mts` formatting, the data-dir precedence test).\n- `bun run ui:smoke` fails at step 1 (a seeded card is not mounted in the virtualized grid) identically on base, so its Settings step is skipped on both. This is tracked as an SQU-124 follow-up.\n- Export, import and copy still go through the same main-process picker calls (SQU-120 code is untouched). The native dialog can't be driven over CDP.\n\n## Before / after (full app)\n\n![Settings before and after](https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ130-settings-before-after.png)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"716dbd38-2776-4057-b6bd-d300318dcf44","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-1