{"parentUuid":"c4de50db-756a-4c51-8fe5-f3ead3e884b7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017Yet6tq7MSLm6j7T6oCuBn","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-130\",\"uuid\":\"a727d18e-32bf-4c42-916a-e78b7a0ce508\",\"title\":\"Stack 5/7: settings sheet and archive\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Stacked on <issue id=\\\"db9c7cad-991d-4d63-b6c2-de667d972621\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-129/stack-47-library-grid-cards-list-view-filters\\\">SQU-129</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nExtract the Settings sheet (General, Archive, Data, Extension panels, extension pairing, library makeup) and the Archive view into `src/features/settings/`. Add `Tabs`, `Switch` and any form primitives on Base UI, restyle with Tailwind, and delete the matching `App.css` blocks (\\\"Settings sheet and Archive\\\").\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* Settings still reopens on Library, its first tab. Cached library size still shows at once and refreshes in the background (do not regress the fix in 69e3641).\\n* Optional facts (version, size, last copy) stay hidden when the backend cannot supply them, in preview and in the full app.\\n* Archive restore, selection mode and delete keep working: a one-way door is a bug. Verify the reverse state for each action.\\n* Export, import and copy flows go through the native picker unchanged; modals stay responsive afterwards (<issue id=\\\"acb06d91-92f0-4150-a807-84ac02bc5aa1\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-120/electron-modal-overlays-stop-responding-after-native-folder-picker\\\">SQU-120</issue>).\\n* Tab keyboard navigation and focus return checked. Before/after images, full app.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-130/stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-130-stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:25.831Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:29:20.468Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T03:12:12.947Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Review\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"5158311c-396a-4294-8c50-58d83af9992a\",\"title\":\"refactor(settings): settings sheet and archive on base ui tabs\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/180\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"assignee\":\"Chris\",\"assigneeId\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"603f15e3-747f-4c8b-aaa3-7498b2b1a0cf","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:29:20.791Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-130\",\"uuid\":\"a727d18e-32bf-4c42-916a-e78b7a0ce508\",\"title\":\"Stack 5/7: settings sheet and archive\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Stacked on <issue id=\\\"db9c7cad-991d-4d63-b6c2-de667d972621\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-129/stack-47-library-grid-cards-list-view-filters\\\">SQU-129</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nExtract the Settings sheet (General, Archive, Data, Extension panels, extension pairing, library makeup) and the Archive view into `src/features/settings/`. Add `Tabs`, `Switch` and any form primitives on Base UI, restyle with Tailwind, and delete the matching `App.css` blocks (\\\"Settings sheet and Archive\\\").\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* Settings still reopens on Library, its first tab. Cached library size still shows at once and refreshes in the background (do not regress the fix in 69e3641).\\n* Optional facts (version, size, last copy) stay hidden when the backend cannot supply them, in preview and in the full app.\\n* Archive restore, selection mode and delete keep working: a one-way door is a bug. Verify the reverse state for each action.\\n* Export, import and copy flows go through the native picker unchanged; modals stay responsive afterwards (<issue id=\\\"acb06d91-92f0-4150-a807-84ac02bc5aa1\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-120/electron-modal-overlays-stop-responding-after-native-folder-picker\\\">SQU-120</issue>).\\n* Tab keyboard navigation and focus return checked. Before/after images, full app.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-130/stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-130-stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:25.831Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:29:20.468Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T03:12:12.947Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Review\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"5158311c-396a-4294-8c50-58d83af9992a\",\"title\":\"refactor(settings): settings sheet and archive on base ui tabs\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/180\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"assignee\":\"Chris\",\"assigneeId\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}],"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"linear","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"]},{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon-256.png","mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"]}],"version":"1.0.2","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","description":"Find and manage issues, projects, and documents in your Linear workspace."}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c4de50db-756a-4c51-8fe5-f3ead3e884b7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
