{"parentUuid":"29cb8808-659c-43cf-81b8-8754bcad50e8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQXwqGpLZu7bGpwz8eYA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should draft the PR body now, covering the focus-return-to-card-on-close fix, explaining why that file grew to 721 lines, mentioning the ItemView lazy chunk change, and making sure I've hit every relevant surface. I also want to flag the bug where pressing Escape in the base fieldset menu was closing the entire view instead of just the menu.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1619,"cache_read_input_tokens":82739,"output_tokens":2334,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":71},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1619,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2334,"cache_read_input_tokens":82739,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1619},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":3397,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgQXwprkmJ4Mf9K6qMVL7","requestRef":"1b57d63b-82c9-4474-83ed-bc99fc80e633","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"claude.ai Linear","attributionMcpTool":"get_issue","type":"assistant","uuid":"141434ce-292d-4d6f-add0-24085ce1b188","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:29:25.303Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"parentUuid":"141434ce-292d-4d6f-add0-24085ce1b188","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQXwqGpLZu7bGpwz8eYA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AHDWqe7ALzHw33bxqEFMCB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > \"$TEMP/squ131/body.md\" <<'EOF'\nLinear: [SQU-131](https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay)\n\nStacked on #180 (SQU-130). Part of the SQU-124 UI refactor.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe item view was a single `ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx` holding the flight, stage, zoom, inspector, tags, Space menu and Similar tab, with about 900 lines of matching CSS in `App.css`. Info/Similar and \"Move to Space\" were hand-rolled widgets with their own keyboard handling.\n\n## Fix\n\n- `src/features/item-view/` now holds:\n  - `ItemView`, which owns the layer, the flight and the layout;\n  - `InfoPanel`, `ItemActionBar`, `ItemStageMedia`, `ZoomableImage`, `ItemTitle` and `SimilarPanel`;\n  - the moved `PdfViewer`, `RichNoteEditor`, `imageZoom` and `overlayMotion`.\n- Info/Similar is Base UI `Tabs`, rendered as the inspector `aside`.\n- \"Move to Space\" is a Base UI `Menu` with checkbox items. Each item's `checked` comes from live Space membership. The menu is portalled inside the item view so it stacks with it.\n- Everything is restyled with Tailwind. Deleted from `App.css`: the item view, Similar tab, PDF viewer and detail media sections, and the retry button (now `RETRY_BUTTON` in `src/ui/Button.tsx`, shared with `LibraryCard`).\n- `ItemView` is lazy-loaded from `App.tsx`. The note editor and PDF viewer stay their own chunks and are still warmed from `useItemDetails`.\n- The flight choreography is moved verbatim, so open/close timing and `App()` ordering are untouched. This is also why `ItemView.tsx` is 721 lines; splitting the GSAP sequence up would risk the ordering for no visible gain.\n- `canvasImageCrossOrigin` stays on the `ItemMedia` images.\n\n### Intentional differences (keyboard and a11y only)\n\n- Info/Similar is now one Tab stop that uses arrow keys, per the WAI tabs pattern. Before, each tab was its own Tab stop.\n- The Space menu now takes focus when it opens. Escape and Tab close only the menu and return focus to \"Move to Space\". Before, the fieldset popup never received keyboard focus, and Escape closed the whole item view, which contradicted the code's own comment.\n- The PDF viewer was not folded onto the `Dialog` primitive. Its backdrop, z-index and full-bleed layout differ from Dialog's, so it was restyled in place instead.\n\n## Hit every surface\n\n- **Entry points:** opening from a card click, from Enter on a focused card, and from history (mouse side buttons, Alt+Left/Right). Closing from Close and from Escape only. Focus returns to the card.\n- **Card types:** all of them open correctly: image, video, post, PDF, note, quote, plus article and file through the shared stage path. Pixel zoom and pan on images, the PDF viewer, the note editor (including narrow windows) and quote layout.\n- **Reverse states:**\n  - Space chips toggle on and off from the menu.\n  - Tags add and remove.\n  - Archive from the view, and restore from Settings.\n  - Delete permanently only on archived items.\n  - Retry on a failed job.\n- **App modes:**\n  - Preview (CSS fallback): compared against base with style dumps and pixel diffs.\n  - Full app (liquid glass): checked with verify-inkling against a scratch library.\n- **Capture and search paths:** not touched. Similar still uses the existing similarity call.\n- **Docs:** `verify-inkling` selectors now point at `src/features/item-view/`. There is no changelog entry, because SQU-132 owns the stack's entry.\n\n## Verification\n\n- **Full app (verify-inkling, scratch library):**\n  - Zoom: at 156% the original image is swapped in, with no shadow on the scaled image. Pixel zoom at 2274% is pixelated with the grid on. Pan moves the translate.\n  - Space menu: it opens with focus on its first item, and Enter toggles Moodboard. The chip appears, and DB `space_items` gains the item. Escape closes only the menu, focus returns to \"Move to Space\", and the view stays open.\n  - Tags: a tag is added, and DB `metadata.tags` holds it.\n  - Similar: the tab is reachable by ArrowRight.\n  - Narrow window: the note editor keeps full height.\n  - Focus mode: the Close button keeps its position.\n  - Archive: archiving from the view sets `archived=1`, and the card leaves the grid.\n- **Pixel diff, base vs branch (full app and preview):** all shared states differ in fewer than 0.03% of pixels. The only changed regions are the mascot, the spinning processing glyph, and job-timing text (palette and status line). The exceptions are the Space-menu states, which differ because of the intentional focus and Escape change above.\n- **`bun run check` parts:** green except the known Windows-only local failures (CRLF `.d.mts` formatting, the data-dir precedence test).\n- The PDF canvas does not render in the unpackaged verify build (\"Setting up fake worker failed\"). This happens identically on base and is tracked as an SQU-124 follow-up.\n\n## Before / after (full app)\n\nLeft is base, right is this branch. The rows are: image info, pixel zoom, Space menu, quote, and PDF.\n\n![Item view before and after](https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ131-before-after.png)\n\nDone by Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code (T3 Code).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create -R Squidys-Tools/inkling --draft --base squidlee/squ-130-stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive --head squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay --title \"refactor(item-view): item view on base ui tabs and menu\" --body-file \"$TEMP/squ131/body.md\"","description":"Open SQU-131 draft PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1619,"cache_read_input_tokens":82739,"output_tokens":2334,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":71},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1619,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2334,"cache_read_input_tokens":82739,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1619},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01AHDWqe7ALzHw33bxqEFMCB":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-a1f541e8 && cat > \"$TEMP/squ131/body.md\" <<'EOF'\nLinear: [SQU-131](https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay)\n\nStacked on #180 (SQU-130). Part of the SQU-124 UI refactor.\n\n## Problem\n\nThe item view was a single `ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx` holding the flight, stage, zoom, inspector, tags, Space menu and Similar tab, with about 900 lines of matching CSS in `App.css`. Info/Similar and \"Move to Space\" were hand-rolled widgets with their own keyboard handling.\n\n## Fix\n\n- `src/features/item-view/` now holds:\n  - `ItemView`, which owns the layer, the flight and the layout;\n  - `InfoPanel`, `ItemActionBar`, `ItemStageMedia`, `ZoomableImage`, `ItemTitle` and `SimilarPanel`;\n  - the moved `PdfViewer`, `RichNoteEditor`, `imageZoom` and `overlayMotion`.\n- Info/Similar is Base UI `Tabs`, rendered as the inspector `aside`.\n- \"Move to Space\" is a Base UI `Menu` with checkbox items. Each item's `checked` comes from live Space membership. The menu is portalled inside the item view so it stacks with it.\n- Everything is restyled with Tailwind. Deleted from `App.css`: the item view, Similar tab, PDF viewer and detail media sections, and the retry button (now `RETRY_BUTTON` in `src/ui/Button.tsx`, shared with `LibraryCard`).\n- `ItemView` is lazy-loaded from `App.tsx`. The note editor and PDF viewer stay their own chunks and are still warmed from `useItemDetails`.\n- The flight choreography is moved verbatim, so open/close timing and `App()` ordering are untouched. This is also why `ItemView.tsx` is 721 lines; splitting the GSAP sequence up would risk the ordering for no visible gain.\n- `canvasImageCrossOrigin` stays on the `ItemMedia` images.\n\n### Intentional differences (keyboard and a11y only)\n\n- Info/Similar is now one Tab stop that uses arrow keys, per the WAI tabs pattern. Before, each tab was its own Tab stop.\n- The Space menu now takes focus when it opens. Escape and Tab close only the menu and return focus to \"Move to Space\". Before, the fieldset popup never received keyboard focus, and Escape closed the whole item view, which contradicted the code's own comment.\n- The PDF viewer was not folded onto the `Dialog` primitive. Its backdrop, z-index and full-bleed layout differ from Dialog's, so it was restyled in place instead.\n\n## Hit every surface\n\n- **Entry points:** opening from a card click, from Enter on a focused card, and from history (mouse side buttons, Alt+Left/Right). Closing from Close and from Escape only. Focus returns to the card.\n- **Card types:** all of them open correctly: image, video, post, PDF, note, quote, plus article and file through the shared stage path. Pixel zoom and pan on images, the PDF viewer, the note editor (including narrow windows) and quote layout.\n- **Reverse states:**\n  - Space chips toggle on and off from the menu.\n  - Tags add and remove.\n  - Archive from the view, and restore from Settings.\n  - Delete permanently only on archived items.\n  - Retry on a failed job.\n- **App modes:**\n  - Preview (CSS fallback): compared against base with style dumps and pixel diffs.\n  - Full app (liquid glass): checked with verify-inkling against a scratch library.\n- **Capture and search paths:** not touched. Similar still uses the existing similarity call.\n- **Docs:** `verify-inkling` selectors now point at `src/features/item-view/`. There is no changelog entry, because SQU-132 owns the stack's entry.\n\n## Verification\n\n- **Full app (verify-inkling, scratch library):**\n  - Zoom: at 156% the original image is swapped in, with no shadow on the scaled image. Pixel zoom at 2274% is pixelated with the grid on. Pan moves the translate.\n  - Space menu: it opens with focus on its first item, and Enter toggles Moodboard. The chip appears, and DB `space_items` gains the item. Escape closes only the menu, focus returns to \"Move to Space\", and the view stays open.\n  - Tags: a tag is added, and DB `metadata.tags` holds it.\n  - Similar: the tab is reachable by ArrowRight.\n  - Narrow window: the note editor keeps full height.\n  - Focus mode: the Close button keeps its position.\n  - Archive: archiving from the view sets `archived=1`, and the card leaves the grid.\n- **Pixel diff, base vs branch (full app and preview):** all shared states differ in fewer than 0.03% of pixels. The only changed regions are the mascot, the spinning processing glyph, and job-timing text (palette and status line). The exceptions are the Space-menu states, which differ because of the intentional focus and Escape change above.\n- **`bun run check` parts:** green except the known Windows-only local failures (CRLF `.d.mts` formatting, the data-dir precedence test).\n- The PDF canvas does not render in the unpackaged verify build (\"Setting up fake worker failed\"). This happens identically on base and is tracked as an SQU-124 follow-up.\n\n## Before / after (full app)\n\nLeft is base, right is this branch. The rows are: image info, pixel zoom, Space menu, quote, and PDF.\n\n![Item view before and after](https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ131-before-after.png)\n\nDone by Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code (T3 Code).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create -R Squidys-Tools/inkling --draft --base squidlee/squ-130-stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive --head squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay --title \"refactor(item-view): item view on base ui tabs and menu\" --body-file \"$TEMP/squ131/body.md\"","description":"Open SQU-131 draft PR"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01AHDWqe7ALzHw33bxqEFMCB":{"cwd":"/c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-a1f541e8"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgQXwprkmJ4Mf9K6qMVL7","requestRef":"1b57d63b-82c9-4474-83ed-bc99fc80e633","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"claude.ai Linear","attributionMcpTool":"get_issue","type":"assistant","uuid":"a8f06eb8-30c2-46a8-81c8-cd185fc65803","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:29:41.415Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
