{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"ef2360fbe50d1bdd7201736367b7ea7559db3d205dbb3d5e6b0ac60c27a15e78","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Er3j13xXVGLc46u5AgBjLf","name":"mcp__t3-code__link_pull_request","input":{"url":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/181"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CHdHmViMxgUEDbNoiDscgZ","name":"mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_issue","input":{"id":"SQU-131","links":[{"url":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/181","title":"refactor(item-view): item view on base ui tabs and menu"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F2S5SRbZVfV2YdYP7P5wxG","name":"mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_comment","input":{"issueId":"SQU-131","body":"Draft PR #181 is up, stacked on #180.\n\nThe item view now lives in `src/features/item-view/`:\n- Info/Similar is Base UI Tabs.\n- \"Move to Space\" is a Base UI Menu whose checkbox items come from live membership.\n- Everything is restyled with Tailwind, and the App.css item-view, Similar and PDF viewer sections are gone.\n- The flight is moved verbatim.\n\nVerified with verify-inkling in the full app:\n- zoom, pixel zoom and pan;\n- Space toggle (DB proof);\n- tags (DB proof);\n- Similar;\n- the narrow note editor;\n- archive (DB proof).\n\nBase vs branch pixel diffs are under 0.03%, apart from the mascot and job timing.\n\nIntentional keyboard differences:\n- The tabs are one Tab stop with arrow keys.\n- The Space menu takes focus, and Escape closes only the menu. On base, Escape closed the whole view.\n\nThe PDF viewer was not folded onto Dialog, because its backdrop and layering differ."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"97216c9e77a31564ac7945273589a75eeda65f99e215782e9f852ec450cbba0c","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Er3j13xXVGLc46u5AgBjLf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"host\":\"github.com\",\"repository\":\"squidys-tools/inkling\",\"number\":181,\"url\":\"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/181\",\"alreadyLinked\":true}"},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CHdHmViMxgUEDbNoiDscgZ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-131\",\"uuid\":\"5142eff8-ddbb-43a9-94f9-fb9eda73ed6e\",\"title\":\"Stack 6/7: item view overlay\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Stacked on <issue id=\\\"a727d18e-32bf-4c42-916a-e78b7a0ce508\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-130/stack-57-settings-sheet-and-archive\\\">SQU-130</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\nSplit `ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx` (1,471 lines, one \\\\~800-line component) into `src/features/item-view/`: zoomable image stage, overlay media, Similar tab (tiles and columns), inspector tabs, space chips, palette swatches, back/forward bar. Use `Tabs` and `Menu` primitives, restyle with Tailwind, and delete the matching `App.css` blocks (\\\"Item view\\\" and \\\"Similar tab\\\" sections). Fold in `PdfViewer.tsx` if it fits the same Dialog primitive.\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* Zoom and pan are unchanged, including pixel zoom. No drop shadow on the scaled image (recomputed on every pan).\\n* Space chips still toggle from live membership. Stale membership reads cannot roll back a chip the user just changed.\\n* The lazy note editor and PDF viewer chunks still load lazily and stay warmed while their overlay opens.\\n* Every card kind opens correctly (article, image, PDF, video, post, note, quote, file) and reverse states still work.\\n* Mascot moves to the inspector corner as before. Before/after images, full app.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:31.888Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:29:49.131Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T03:55:28.164Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"20fee431-5e2a-4203-92b2-0e0602fb47ff\",\"title\":\"refactor(item-view): item view on base ui tabs and menu\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/181\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"assignee\":\"Chris\",\"assigneeId\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F2S5SRbZVfV2YdYP7P5wxG","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"3050acc4-a51b-4f2f-a09c-c6332f196623\",\"body\":\"Draft PR #181 is up, stacked on #180.\\n\\nThe item view now lives in `src/features/item-view/`:\\n- Info/Similar is Base UI Tabs.\\n- \\\"Move to Space\\\" is a Base UI Menu whose checkbox items come from live membership.\\n- Everything is restyled with Tailwind, and the App.css item-view, Similar and PDF viewer sections are gone.\\n- The flight is moved verbatim.\\n\\nVerified with verify-inkling in the full app:\\n- zoom, pixel zoom and pan;\\n- Space toggle (DB proof);\\n- tags (DB proof);\\n- Similar;\\n- the narrow note editor;\\n- archive (DB proof).\\n\\nBase vs branch pixel diffs are under 0.03%, apart from the mascot and job timing.\\n\\nIntentional keyboard differences:\\n- The tabs are one Tab stop with arrow keys.\\n- The Space menu takes focus, and Escape closes only the menu. On base, Escape closed the whole view.\\n\\nThe PDF viewer was not folded onto Dialog, because its backdrop and layering differ.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:29:50.708Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:29:50.687Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"name\":\"Chris\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}"}]}]}}
