{"parentUuid":"6429d3c4-cdee-4715-b214-35ab4898e918","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NruvZPu1qTj7gLELqyM1Vx","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-132\",\"uuid\":\"a81ffc45-26f3-4655-9883-9156b08ea3cd\",\"title\":\"Stack 7/7: onboarding, reader, cleanup, delete App.css\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Top of the stack, stacked on <issue id=\\\"5142eff8-ddbb-43a9-94f9-fb9eda73ed6e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay\\\">SQU-131</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* Move what is left in `App.css` to its owner: onboarding keyframes and GSAP-targeted selectors next to `FirstRunOverlay` and `components/onboarding/*`, toast styling next to the Toaster, then delete `App.css`.\\n* `reader.css` stays plain CSS (it styles untrusted article HTML through descendant selectors). Move it next to `ReaderView` and point it at the shared tokens.\\n* Confirm no `src/` file is still a god file (nothing in the UI over \\\\~600 lines without a reason).\\n* Docs: rewrite `docs/tech-stack.md` so the styling row matches reality and Zustand/TanStack Query are either removed or justified; update `docs/design.md` tokens to the real ones; add a `docs/changelog.md` line under Changed referencing <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Rewrite existing text, do not append.\\n* Update `t3.json`, `knip.json` and `biome.jsonc` if any script, entry or ignore changed.\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* `App.css` is gone and `bun run check` passes.\\n* Onboarding plays through unchanged, including the screen order and the mascot rhythm; reader renders sanitized article HTML as before.\\n* Final walkthrough of every surface in the full app, with a short video for any motion.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-132/stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:43.406Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-22T08:22:46.382Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"823f1744-58d5-4643-b4e0-60e2011defe5\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:43.406Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"72f58665-8b23-4423-ade6-2535578269c7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:29:57.015Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-132\",\"uuid\":\"a81ffc45-26f3-4655-9883-9156b08ea3cd\",\"title\":\"Stack 7/7: onboarding, reader, cleanup, delete App.css\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Top of the stack, stacked on <issue id=\\\"5142eff8-ddbb-43a9-94f9-fb9eda73ed6e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay\\\">SQU-131</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* Move what is left in `App.css` to its owner: onboarding keyframes and GSAP-targeted selectors next to `FirstRunOverlay` and `components/onboarding/*`, toast styling next to the Toaster, then delete `App.css`.\\n* `reader.css` stays plain CSS (it styles untrusted article HTML through descendant selectors). Move it next to `ReaderView` and point it at the shared tokens.\\n* Confirm no `src/` file is still a god file (nothing in the UI over \\\\~600 lines without a reason).\\n* Docs: rewrite `docs/tech-stack.md` so the styling row matches reality and Zustand/TanStack Query are either removed or justified; update `docs/design.md` tokens to the real ones; add a `docs/changelog.md` line under Changed referencing <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Rewrite existing text, do not append.\\n* Update `t3.json`, `knip.json` and `biome.jsonc` if any script, entry or ignore changed.\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* `App.css` is gone and `bun run check` passes.\\n* Onboarding plays through unchanged, including the screen order and the mascot rhythm; reader renders sanitized article HTML as before.\\n* Final walkthrough of every surface in the full app, with a short video for any motion.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-132/stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:43.406Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-22T08:22:46.382Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"823f1744-58d5-4643-b4e0-60e2011defe5\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:43.406Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}],"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"linear","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"]},{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon-256.png","mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"]}],"version":"1.0.2","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","description":"Find and manage issues, projects, and documents in your Linear workspace."}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6429d3c4-cdee-4715-b214-35ab4898e918","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"parentUuid":"aa3ac5bf-5dee-40db-8ca7-cfa447b3c645","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y4gxULD7Eh146dp9o1jQf8","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"f3a8886e-2f65-4392-8861-bf853b1cfecc\",\"body\":\"## Since this was written\\n\\n**Onboarding (#173)** was redrawn and animated. Move only its CSS and keyframes. The screens and mascot rhythm are product intent.\\n\\n**Docs.** `tech-stack.md` and `design.md` must describe the liquid glass layer:\\n- the WebGPU canvas\\n- the `.glass` and `.css-glass` contract\\n- the CSS fallback in preview and on machines without WebGPU\\n\\n**Test prune** (following T3 Code pingdotgg/t3code#22557), across `src/` and `electron/`:\\n- **Delete:** type-redundant checks, trivial logic, basic DOM behavior, static-markup renders, mock-call mirrors, smoke tests, duplicate table rows, wall-clock or perf asserts.\\n- **Keep:**\\n  - extraction and sanitizing, embed allowlists, OCR scoring\\n  - queue leases and recovery, migrations and persistence\\n  - asset path containment and range requests\\n  - deep link and external-format parsing\\n  - ordering and race guarantees, `liquidGlassShape`\\n  - any test added by a fix commit. Mark it `// regression: #NNN` if its name doesn't say so.\\n- Remove helpers, fixtures and exports that only the deleted tests used, with no product-code change.\\n- Report before and after test counts and `bun test` time in the PR.\\n\\n**AGENTS.md.** Add the comment and test rules from the SQU-124 \\\"Brief\\\" comment to its Taste and Verifying sections, in its own voice. Rewrite the existing lines rather than appending to them. No custom lint rules for either.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-22T03:47:17.293Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-22T03:47:17.253Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"name\":\"Chris\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}]}]},"uuid":"ef3ddd07-d592-48cb-a293-5f92201212a7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:29:57.704Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"f3a8886e-2f65-4392-8861-bf853b1cfecc\",\"body\":\"## Since this was written\\n\\n**Onboarding (#173)** was redrawn and animated. Move only its CSS and keyframes. The screens and mascot rhythm are product intent.\\n\\n**Docs.** `tech-stack.md` and `design.md` must describe the liquid glass layer:\\n- the WebGPU canvas\\n- the `.glass` and `.css-glass` contract\\n- the CSS fallback in preview and on machines without WebGPU\\n\\n**Test prune** (following T3 Code pingdotgg/t3code#22557), across `src/` and `electron/`:\\n- **Delete:** type-redundant checks, trivial logic, basic DOM behavior, static-markup renders, mock-call mirrors, smoke tests, duplicate table rows, wall-clock or perf asserts.\\n- **Keep:**\\n  - extraction and sanitizing, embed allowlists, OCR scoring\\n  - queue leases and recovery, migrations and persistence\\n  - asset path containment and range requests\\n  - deep link and external-format parsing\\n  - ordering and race guarantees, `liquidGlassShape`\\n  - any test added by a fix commit. Mark it `// regression: #NNN` if its name doesn't say so.\\n- Remove helpers, fixtures and exports that only the deleted tests used, with no product-code change.\\n- Report before and after test counts and `bun test` time in the PR.\\n\\n**AGENTS.md.** Add the comment and test rules from the SQU-124 \\\"Brief\\\" comment to its Taste and Verifying sections, in its own voice. Rewrite the existing lines rather than appending to them. No custom lint rules for either.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-22T03:47:17.293Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-22T03:47:17.253Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"name\":\"Chris\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"linear","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"]},{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon-256.png","mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"]}],"version":"1.0.2","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","description":"Find and manage issues, projects, and documents in your Linear workspace."}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"aa3ac5bf-5dee-40db-8ca7-cfa447b3c645","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
