{"parentUuid":"f374606a-e386-4e04-8f50-18077094a188","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JnwCfYksop5X4UBdYsk1TH","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-132\",\"uuid\":\"a81ffc45-26f3-4655-9883-9156b08ea3cd\",\"title\":\"Stack 7/7: onboarding, reader, cleanup, delete App.css\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Top of the stack, stacked on <issue id=\\\"5142eff8-ddbb-43a9-94f9-fb9eda73ed6e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay\\\">SQU-131</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* Move what is left in `App.css` to its owner: onboarding keyframes and GSAP-targeted selectors next to `FirstRunOverlay` and `components/onboarding/*`, toast styling next to the Toaster, then delete `App.css`.\\n* `reader.css` stays plain CSS (it styles untrusted article HTML through descendant selectors). Move it next to `ReaderView` and point it at the shared tokens.\\n* Confirm no `src/` file is still a god file (nothing in the UI over \\\\~600 lines without a reason).\\n* Docs: rewrite `docs/tech-stack.md` so the styling row matches reality and Zustand/TanStack Query are either removed or justified; update `docs/design.md` tokens to the real ones; add a `docs/changelog.md` line under Changed referencing <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Rewrite existing text, do not append.\\n* Update `t3.json`, `knip.json` and `biome.jsonc` if any script, entry or ignore changed.\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* `App.css` is gone and `bun run check` passes.\\n* Onboarding plays through unchanged, including the screen order and the mascot rhythm; reader renders sanitized article HTML as before.\\n* Final walkthrough of every surface in the full app, with a short video for any motion.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-132/stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:43.406Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:30:10.411Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:30:10.351Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"assignee\":\"Chris\",\"assigneeId\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}]}]},"uuid":"41e0a6c9-a76d-4c01-83b3-370ca64b17af","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:30:11.375Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-132\",\"uuid\":\"a81ffc45-26f3-4655-9883-9156b08ea3cd\",\"title\":\"Stack 7/7: onboarding, reader, cleanup, delete App.css\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Top of the stack, stacked on <issue id=\\\"5142eff8-ddbb-43a9-94f9-fb9eda73ed6e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay\\\">SQU-131</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* Move what is left in `App.css` to its owner: onboarding keyframes and GSAP-targeted selectors next to `FirstRunOverlay` and `components/onboarding/*`, toast styling next to the Toaster, then delete `App.css`.\\n* `reader.css` stays plain CSS (it styles untrusted article HTML through descendant selectors). Move it next to `ReaderView` and point it at the shared tokens.\\n* Confirm no `src/` file is still a god file (nothing in the UI over \\\\~600 lines without a reason).\\n* Docs: rewrite `docs/tech-stack.md` so the styling row matches reality and Zustand/TanStack Query are either removed or justified; update `docs/design.md` tokens to the real ones; add a `docs/changelog.md` line under Changed referencing <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Rewrite existing text, do not append.\\n* Update `t3.json`, `knip.json` and `biome.jsonc` if any script, entry or ignore changed.\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* `App.css` is gone and `bun run check` passes.\\n* Onboarding plays through unchanged, including the screen order and the mascot rhythm; reader renders sanitized article HTML as before.\\n* Final walkthrough of every surface in the full app, with a short video for any motion.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-132/stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:43.406Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:30:10.411Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:30:10.351Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"assignee\":\"Chris\",\"assigneeId\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}],"mcpMeta":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"linear","title":"Linear","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml","sizes":["any"]},{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon-256.png","mimeType":"image/png","sizes":["256x256"]}],"version":"1.0.2","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","description":"Find and manage issues, projects, and documents in your Linear workspace."}}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f374606a-e386-4e04-8f50-18077094a188","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
