{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"d4816f87964e3c224929309d4fac2e0210be7deb5201aa2e704b289d238b999c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to reconsider CSS import ordering now — since index.css moved, the unlayered styles from components like Surface, AddMenu, SegmentedControl, and reader load relative to it differently than before, since main.tsx imports App (which pulls in component CSS) before index.css itself.\n\nSince focus-visible rules now cascade after all component styles, there's a small risk of conflicts, but since Tailwind utility layers aren't affected by plain CSS ordering, this should generally be fine. Moving on, I need to rename visually-hidden to sr-only.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Next, `visually-hidden` becomes Tailwind's `sr-only`, and the `paper-*` accents become background utilities."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Uvmd1nAXgBWotBW7BBqND7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-a1f541e8 && grep -rn \"visually-hidden\" src --include=*.tsx --include=*.css | grep -v App.css","description":"Show visually-hidden usages"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
