vw, 697px\" alt=\"settings\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1051717\" /></noscript><br />If Apple's Liquid Glass UI embrace in iOS 26 wasn't your thing, there's a way to tone it down. In iOS 27, Apple added a full Liquid Glass slider under Settings ➝ Appearance ➝ Liquid Glass. It changes the translucency of Liquid Glass elements, and you can choose a clear version of Liquid Glass that allows some of the background to show through, select a more opaque, tinted version that improves the legibility of text, or choose something in between.<br />\ndocs/changelog.md:193:- Automatic first-run download and cache of the published INT8 Nomic model artifacts","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"57685117-094d-4fb1-b984-acf3b1f728b1","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:33:23.099Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"benchmarks/corpus/live/macrumors/2026-08-14-new-things-your-iphone-can-do-ios-27.html:397:<p><img alt=\"settings\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1051717 lazyload\" src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/images-new/1x1.trans.gif\" data-src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/vg99lc4jRZ_-N0H_Uyo6cKRi8Gg=/400x0/article-new/2026/06/liquid-glass-opacity-setting-ios-27.jpeg?lossy\" data-srcset=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/vg99lc4jRZ_-N0H_Uyo6cKRi8Gg=/400x0/article-new/2026/06/liquid-glass-opacity-setting-ios-27.jpeg?lossy 400w,https://images.macrumors.com/t/REDACTED/800x0/article-new/2026/06/liquid-glass-opacity-setting-ios-27.jpeg?lossy 800w,https://images.macrumors.com/t/REDACTED/1600x0/article-new/2026/06/liquid-glass-opacity-setting-ios-27.jpeg 1600w,https://images.macrumors.com/t/C3fEiITJL7moUkRGtkSeqoo8Gmg=/2500x0/filters:no_upscale()/article-new/2026/06/liquid-glass-opacity-setting-ios-27.jpeg 2500w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1920/1080\" /><noscript><img src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/vg99lc4jRZ_-N0H_Uyo6cKRi8Gg=/400x0/article-new/2026/06/liquid-glass-opacity-setting-ios-27.jpeg