{"parentUuid":"9bc4acb7-09aa-4693-b76a-5fc65ab6e1b2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014JmwJ9RAico6R6g6QCifda","type":"tool_result","content":"src/components/FirstRunOverlay.tsx:39:/** How long a screen takes to leave before the next one comes in; matches fr-stage-out in App.css. */\nsrc/components/onboarding/MemoryMatch.tsx:17:/** Matches --memory-card-w / --memory-card-h in App.css. */\nsrc/features/library/LibraryCard.tsx:353:            ? // App.css's unlayered focus ring outranks a plain utility; the\nsrc/features/settings/SettingsSheet.tsx:119:            // The dialog takes focus on open; App.css's unlayered focus ring\nelectron/main.mjs:358:    // 320px matches the body min-width in src/App.css. At 240px high the library grid shrinks to 65px; 360px keeps it near 185px.\ndocs/changelog.md:55:- Sidebar mascot now commutes into the search field on focus (attentive, curious with a bob while typing) through one shared engine while the sidebar slot collapses so the wordmark slides over; the focused field shows only the mascot's eyes and the old static field equalizer is retired (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`)\ndocs/changelog.md:111:- Toasts restyled as a catalog drawer slip for Undo actions and a compact ink-slip chip for success/error (shared palette, plain content, HugeIcons close control, top-right entry/exit, 5s status auto-dismiss, persistent Undo) (SQU-6, `src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`)\ndocs/changelog.md:123:- Faster cold boot with no visual changes: the PDF viewer, reader, item overlay, and dev-only mascot boards now load on first open instead of at startup (boot JavaScript down from ~1269 kB to ~808 kB), shell fonts load via parallel stylesheet links instead of a render-blocking import, search waits 200 ms after typing before querying, and background refresh pauses while the window is hidden (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`, `index.html`, `vite.config.ts`)\ndocs/changelog.md:125:- Spaces can be renamed (inline), recolored (click the dot to cycle), and reordered (hover up/down controls), closing the one-way door on a misspelled Space name; reorder runs through a new atomic `swap_space_positions` command so it can never half-apply (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`, `src/lib/libraryApi.ts`, `src-tauri/src/storage.rs`)\ndocs/changelog.md:128:- Archive now lives in Settings instead of the sidebar, and the settings modal uses theme variables instead of hardcoded colors (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`)\ndocs/changelog.md:130:- Library grid and list views soften into a progressive blur at the top edge, under the search bar, and the bottom edge, down to the window's last pixel; both stay in place while scrolling (`src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx`, `src/components/GradualBlur/`, `src/App.css`, `src/App.tsx`)\ndocs/changelog.md:137:- Dead `note-art` / `note-pin` / `note-scribble` card styles left over from the note thumbnail reuse (`src/App.css`)\n$ tsc-rs --noEmit && tsc-rs -p benchmarks/harness/tsconfig.json --noEmit\nChecked 84 files in 121ms. Fixed 5 files.\n[This command modified 2 files you've previously read: src\\components\\LiquidGlass.tsx, src\\features\\library\\LibraryStage.tsx. Call Read before editing.]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cdf12bc4-f485-44b1-b9e6-822ba2eed1f4","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:36:57.241Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"src/components/FirstRunOverlay.tsx:39:/** How long a screen takes to leave before the next one comes in; matches fr-stage-out in App.css. */\nsrc/components/onboarding/MemoryMatch.tsx:17:/** Matches --memory-card-w / --memory-card-h in App.css. */\nsrc/features/library/LibraryCard.tsx:353:            ? // App.css's unlayered focus ring outranks a plain utility; the\nsrc/features/settings/SettingsSheet.tsx:119:            // The dialog takes focus on open; App.css's unlayered focus ring\nelectron/main.mjs:358:    // 320px matches the body min-width in src/App.css. At 240px high the library grid shrinks to 65px; 360px keeps it near 185px.\ndocs/changelog.md:55:- Sidebar mascot now commutes into the search field on focus (attentive, curious with a bob while typing) through one shared engine while the sidebar slot collapses so the wordmark slides over; the focused field shows only the mascot's eyes and the old static field equalizer is retired (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`)\ndocs/changelog.md:111:- Toasts restyled as a catalog drawer slip for Undo actions and a compact ink-slip chip for success/error (shared palette, plain content, HugeIcons close control, top-right entry/exit, 5s status auto-dismiss, persistent Undo) (SQU-6, `src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`)\ndocs/changelog.md:123:- Faster cold boot with no visual changes: the PDF viewer, reader, item overlay, and dev-only mascot boards now load on first open instead of at startup (boot JavaScript down from ~1269 kB to ~808 kB), shell fonts load via parallel stylesheet links instead of a render-blocking import, search waits 200 ms after typing before querying, and background refresh pauses while the window is hidden (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`, `index.html`, `vite.config.ts`)\ndocs/changelog.md:125:- Spaces can be renamed (inline), recolored (click the dot to cycle), and reordered (hover up/down controls), closing the one-way door on a misspelled Space name; reorder runs through a new atomic `swap_space_positions` command so it can never half-apply (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`, `src/lib/libraryApi.ts`, `src-tauri/src/storage.rs`)\ndocs/changelog.md:128:- Archive now lives in Settings instead of the sidebar, and the settings modal uses theme variables instead of hardcoded colors (`src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`)\ndocs/changelog.md:130:- Library grid and list views soften into a progressive blur at the top edge, under the search bar, and the bottom edge, down to the window's last pixel; both stay in place while scrolling (`src/components/LibraryEdgeFade.tsx`, `src/components/GradualBlur/`, `src/App.css`,