{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"4a54751b10191c31f426e59a8de4bf601bda039ea4069f9bd479731e7b352569","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the specificity order confirms 780 wins over 1120. Switching that background shorthand to background-color is safe since there's nothing else layered in the content. I'm also checking whether the liquid canvas selector targeting full-screen width applies here, but that's scoped to ZoomableImage's LiquidGlass, not LibraryStage, so it's unrelated.\n\nNext I'll run biome lint and knip on the changed files, update knip.json to remove the stale fontsource ignoreDependencies entry, and skip test runs since these are CSS-only changes. For visual verification I'll need base screenshots from the SQU-131 commit — I'll check that out in a detached HEAD in the worktree rather than fighting over the branch reference. I'll finish the remaining code tasks (test pruning, AGENTS.md, docs) first and do UI verification as one final pass across onboarding, reader, toasts, note editor, and sidebar frame.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The emitted CSS order is right: the `max-[780px]` rules come after `max-[1120px]`, and the stage overrides outrank the canvas's own utilities. Next: knip and lint."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HQuoZG5YgLXNQhagjeassr","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-a1f541e8 && python - <<'EOF'\np='knip.json'\ns=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ns=s.replace(',\\n      \"ignoreDependencies\": [\"@fontsource/.+\", \"@fontsource-variable/.+\"]','')\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='\\n').write(s)\nEOF\nunset ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE; bun run knip 2>&1 | tail -8; bun run lint 2>&1 | grep -E \"^\\S+\\.(m?ts|tsx|css|json|jsonc)\" ","description":"Drop knip font ignore, run knip and lint","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
