{"parentUuid":"5a5571bb-a6b8-42de-b112-50f3af112034","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQYm55q6p8GoRxLngrX3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Looking at notes.test.ts, I'll keep most of it since it covers sanitizing and external-format parsing tied to the #98 regression fix, but the trivial `normalizeNoteBody` line-ending test seems safe to drop since it's far from the #175 diff. For deepLink, I'll keep everything, though I want to check if \"rejects non-http targets\" and a similarly-named test are actually duplicates.\n\nFor extension-capture, the sanitizing and card-type tests look worth keeping. In libraryApi.test.ts, several tests around filing items in/out of Spaces, reading Spaces, job counts, hydration, OCR enqueue, and update checks look like they're just mirroring mock calls to the IPC bridge rather than testing real behavior—I should read the file itself to confirm before deciding to prune any of these.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3765,"cache_read_input_tokens":220543,"output_tokens":540,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":379},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3765,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":540,"cache_read_input_tokens":220543,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3765,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3765},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8085,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgQYm4izy3MePz4gFHtp8","requestRef":"90f4f5a3-5131-4b29-8736-d5ae02adc2a2","requestedModel"