{"parentUuid":"4ee69f8f-b3ad-4a00-82b9-1e54c30bddf2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Qp2LiKWTqZUd3aU9w1M44B","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"09653792-ee9f-41e7-961b-55318ce6c53a","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:41:10.690Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"parentUuid":"09653792-ee9f-41e7-961b-55318ce6c53a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQYqQYiuogoSFGCbtQ1D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Most of these electron tests fall into categories I want to keep—queues, leases, recovery, extraction, OCR, range requests, containment, external formats, persistence. Looking at asset-response tests specifically, I'm weighing which are trivial versus security-relevant: the GET/HEAD restriction and range handling seem worth keeping, while the unknown-extension fallback behavior feels like a candidate for removal since it's fairly trivial.\n\nGoing through the rest, I'm inclined to keep the embeddings unicode validation test, both updater feed-checking tests (they guard the \"no network calls in dev\" rule cheaply), thumbnail format support, all capture-server tests, library-size edge cases, pdf tests, and the ai-jobs-lazy startup/ordering guarantees. So out of electron tests, I'm only cutting one. Now I need to move on to listing the 37 tests in storage.test.ts.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3737,"cache_read_input_tokens":235106,"output_tokens":833,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":630},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3737,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":833,"cache_read_input_tokens":235106,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3737,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3737},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9034,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg