{"parentUuid":"c5c01205-2b8d-4596-a38c-e5a5fb7b2351","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MmeSvbZwAf8YdXtckX2V6w","type":"tool_result","content":"99:## Verifying\n101:- Smallest proof that the change works. `bun test <files>` for the tests you touched, targeted lint and typecheck for the scope you changed. The full check is `bun run check`, which mirrors the CI frontend job. Do not run it unless you changed something broad or the user asked.\n103:- Test meaningful logic or observable behavior. Do not render components to static markup just to assert props, and do not add tests that mirror the implementation or assert wiring with no behavior.\n104:- Ingestion and background changes ship with focused tests for that behavior. Extraction, OCR scoring, queue leases, recovery. A behavior change with no test is unfinished.\n105:- Background work is async. Wait on real completion, job drains and lease states, never on fixed sleeps. A test that needs a timeout to pass is wrong.\n168:## Taste\n172:- Comments say why: a constraint, an external quirk, or an invariant the code can't show. Don't restate names or signatures, narrate steps, or record history.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0b443752-59f0-4484-bfdf-b38e23091fc8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:42:32.816Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"99:## Verifying\n101:- Smallest proof that the change works. `bun test <files>` for the tests you touched, targeted lint and typecheck for the scope you changed. The full check is `bun run check`, which mirrors the CI frontend job. Do not run it unless you changed something broad or the user asked.\n103:- Test meaningful logic or observable behavior. Do not render components to static markup just to assert props, and do not add tests that mirror the implementation or assert wiring with no behavior.\n104:- Ingestion and background changes ship with focused tests for that behavior. Extraction, OCR scoring, queue leases, recovery. A behavior change with no test is unfinished.\n105:- Background work is async. Wait on real completion, job drains and lease states, never on fixed sleeps. A test that needs a timeout to pass is wrong.\n168:## Taste\n172:- Comments say why: a constraint, an external quirk, or an invariant the code can't show. Don't restate names or signatures, narrate steps, or record history.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c5c01205-2b8d-4596-a38c-e5a5fb7b2351","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
