{"parentUuid":"057aa34d-0479-4f92-b667-c713b2962630","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WDdpW4XRFxVtPaob96ft2u","type":"tool_result","content":"Archiving an item hides it from a Regular Space without removing it, so restoring the item returns it to the Space it was filed in. Deleting an item for good removes it from every Space.\n\nUsers should be able to create, rename, reorder, recolor, and delete Spaces. Deleting a Space must not delete its items.\n\n## Reading and writing\n\nArticles should open in a distraction-free reader with clean typography, cached images, headings and links, code blocks, footnotes where available, safe supported video embeds, and an original source link at the bottom.\n\nFocus Mode provides a sparse writing environment with headings, bold text, links, and simple interactive todos, using the existing WYSIWYG Markdown editor.\n\n## Onboarding\n\nFirst-run onboarding should explain:\n\n- The library is local-first.\n- AI processing runs on the device where supported.\n- Content may still require network access when fetching a URL or remote media.\n- The user can export and back up their library.\n\nAfter onboarding, this information should not dominate the main experience.\n\n## Explicit non-goals","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"09d61631-01b7-4793-8353-87c177f2663d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:44:05.366Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Archiving an item hides it from a Regular Space without removing it, so restoring the item returns it to the Space it was filed in. Deleting an item for good removes it from every Space.\n\nUsers should be able to create, rename, reorder, recolor, and delete Spaces. Deleting a Space must not delete its items.\n\n## Reading and writing\n\nArticles should open in a distraction-free reader with clean typography, cached images, headings and links, code blocks, footnotes where available, safe supported video embeds, and an original source link at the bottom.\n\nFocus Mode provides a sparse writing environment with headings, bold text, links, and simple interactive todos, using the existing WYSIWYG Markdown editor.\n\n## Onboarding\n\nFirst-run onboarding should explain:\n\n- The library is local-first.\n- AI processing runs on the device where supported.\n- Content may still require network access when fetching a URL or remote media.\n- The user can export and back up their library.\n\nAfter onboarding, this information should not dominate the main experience.\n\n## Explicit non-goals","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"057aa34d-0479-4f92-b667-c713b2962630","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
