{"parentUuid":"63381a2d-debd-4891-8d55-32c33e03f98a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015VFLVL32EHZrU5BPQbV9gb","type":"tool_result","content":"### Changed\n\n- Add opens in place into a small menu of Note, Link, Quote, File and Screen, after Viora UI's Create New Disclosure, replacing the capture dialog and the extra Add button in the library toolbar (#170)\n- The sidebar closes from a button beside the inkling wordmark, shown while the pointer is over it, and reopens from a glass button at the left of the library toolbar, replacing the tab on the frame's edge (#170)\n- Library list IPC sends card fields only; reader content is loaded from SQLite when opened.\n- Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n- Switching between grid and list fades the cards out and pops the new view in, list rows top to bottom and grid cards from the top left, instead of morphing each card between layouts (#170)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1d182739-48d5-47c9-b491-08f9667db533","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:44:25.204Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"### Changed\n\n- Add opens in place into a small menu of Note, Link, Quote, File and Screen, after Viora UI's Create New Disclosure, replacing the capture dialog and the extra Add button in the library toolbar (#170)\n- The sidebar closes from a button beside the inkling wordmark, shown while the pointer is over it, and reopens from a glass button at the left of the library toolbar, replacing the tab on the frame's edge (#170)\n- Library list IPC sends card fields only; reader content is loaded from SQLite when opened.\n- Library cards load remote images in CORS mode and the desktop app adds a CORS header to image responses, so the liquid glass canvas can draw them; no extra requests are made (#170)\n- Switching between grid and list fades the cards out and pops the new view in, list rows top to bottom and grid cards from the top left, instead of morphing each card between layouts (#170)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"63381a2d-debd-4891-8d55-32c33e03f98a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
