9 refactor(capture): capture bar, shortcuts dialog and Dialog/SearchField primitives\n51a2df3 refactor(app): extract app state into feature hooks\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
