{"parentUuid":"c8290e03-be27-405a-a165-bcb59d4f9149","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cda62929-1bba-4a09-ba3d-cc680eb61184","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016oKad1WNN37C7QzdCjNv4W","type":"tool_result","content":" M AGENTS.md\n M docs/README.md\n M docs/changelog.md\n M docs/design.md\nD  docs/expanded-item-overlay.md\n M docs/product-behavior.md\n M docs/tech-stack.md\n M electron/asset-response.test.ts\n M electron/main.mjs\n M knip.json\nD  src/App.css\n M src/App.tsx\n M src/components/Breadcrumb.tsx\n M src/components/FirstRunOverlay.tsx\nD  src/components/ItemMedia.test.ts\n M src/components/ItemMedia.tsx\n M src/components/LiquidGlass.tsx\n M src/components/SegmentedControl/SegmentedControl.tsx\n M src/components/mascot/MascotHomeSlot.tsx\n M src/components/mascot/SearchOutline.test.ts\n M src/components/mascot/alive.test.ts\nD  src/components/mascot/inklingSkins.test.ts\n M src/components/mascot/readmeMascot.test.ts\n M src/components/onboarding/MemoryMatch.tsx\n M src/features/capture/AddMenu/AddMenu.css\n M src/features/capture/AddMenu/AddMenu.tsx\n M src/features/capture/ShortcutsDialog.tsx\n M src/features/capture/useCapture.ts\n M src/features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.tsx\n M src/features/item-view/imageZoom.test.ts\n M src/features/library/LibraryCard.tsx\n M src/features/library/LibraryStage.tsx\n M src/features/library/ViewDock.tsx\n M src/features/library/libraryItem.ts\n M src/features/library/seed.ts\n M src/features/settings/ArchivePanel.tsx\n M src/features/settings/ExtensionPairing.tsx\n M src/features/settings/SettingsSheet.tsx\n M src/features/shell/Sidebar.tsx\n M src/features/shell/SpacesSection.tsx\n M src/index.css\n M src/lib/assetUrlCache.test.ts\n M src/lib/keyboardShortcuts.test.ts\n M src/lib/libraryApi.test.ts\n M src/lib/noteMarkdown.test.ts\n M src/lib/notes.test.ts\n M src/lib/previewMode.test.ts\n M src/lib/previewMode.ts\n M src/main.tsx\n M src/ui/IconButton.tsx\n M src/ui/Surface.css\n?? src/components/onboarding/onboarding.css\n?? src/features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.css\n?? src/ui/Toaster.css\n?? src/ui/Toaster.tsx\n  579 src/reader.css\n  157 src/ReaderView.tsx\n  736 total\nsrc/ReaderView.tsx:5:import \"./reader.css\";\ndocs/tech-stack.md:27:Components style themselves with Tailwind utilities against the tokens in `src/index.css`. Base UI supplies behavior and accessibility for dialogs, tabs, menus and buttons, with no theme of its own. Plain CSS files are kept only where utilities can't reach: `reader.css` and the note editor style HTML they don't render themselves, onboarding runs on keyframes, and Sonner's toasts are styled through its data attributes. Those files sit next to the component that owns them.\n75:  --reader-bg: var(--color-canvas);\n76:  --reader-surface: var(--color-surface);\n77:  --reader-ink: var(--color-ink);\n78:  --reader-muted: var(--color-muted);\n79:  --reader-faint: var(--color-muted);\n80:  --reader-rule: var(--color-border);\n81:  --reader-accent: var(--color-accent);\n82:  --reader-code-bg: var(--color-surface-raised);\n88:  background: var(--reader-bg);\n89:  color: var(--reader-ink);\n99:    circle 340px at var(--reader-origin-x, 50%) var(--reader-origin-y, 50%),\n100:    color-mix(in srgb, var(--reader-accent) 14%, transparent),\n110:    transform-origin: var(--reader-origin-x, 50%) var(--reader-origin-y, 50%);\n118:    transform-origin: var(--reader-origin-x, 50%) var(--reader-origin-y, 50%);\n128:    #000 120px,\n129:    #000 calc(100% - 110px),\n135:    #000 120px,\n136:    #000 calc(100% - 110px),\n143:  top: var(--spacing-component);\n144:  right: clamp(var(--spacing-component), 3vw, 32px);\n151:  border: 1px solid var(--reader-rule);\n153:  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--reader-surface) 72%, transparent);\n155:  color: var(--reader-muted);\n164:  color: var(--reader-ink);\n165:  border-color: var(--reader-faint);\n171:  background: var(--reader-code-bg);\n172:  font: 500 10px var(--font-body);\n223:  font-family: var(--reader-font-heading);\n225:  font-weight: var(--reader-heading-weight);\n227:  letter-spacing: var(--reader-heading-tracking);\n228:  color: var(--reader-ink);\n236:  margin: var(--spacing-component) 0 0;\n237:  color: var(--reader-muted);\n238:  font-family: var(--reader-font-meta);\n246:  color: var(--reader-faint);\n250:  font-family: var(--reader-font-body);\n251:  font-size: var(--reader-body-size);\n253:  color: var(--reader-ink);\n260:  color: var(--reader-muted);\n276:  color: var(--reader-accent);\n278:  text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--reader-accent) 45%, transparent);\n283:  text-decoration-color: var(--reader-accent);\n293:  font-family: var(--reader-font-heading);\n294:  font-weight: var(--reader-heading-weight);\n296:  letter-spacing: var(--reader-heading-tracking);\n297:  color: var(--reader-ink);\n325:  font-family: var(--reader-font-list);\n333:  color: var(--reader-accent);\n339:  border-left: 2px solid var(--reader-accent);\n340:  background: var(--reader-quote-bg);\n341:  font-family: var(--reader-font-quote);\n345:  color: var(--reader-ink);\n367:  color: var(--reader-muted);\n368:  font-family: var(--reader-font-meta);\n377:  border: 1px solid var(--reader-rule);\n379:  background: var(--reader-code-bg);\n380:  font-family: var(--font-body);\n388:  background: var(--reader-code-bg);\n389:  font-family: var(--font-body);\n402:  border-top: 1px solid var(--reader-rule);","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7ea1db27-f091-43f4-8376-db3e632cde36","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:46:10.553Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" M AGENTS.md\n M docs/README.md\n M docs/changelog.md\n M docs/design.md\nD  docs/expanded-item-overlay.md\n M docs/product-behavior.md\n M docs/tech-stack.md\n M electron/asset-response.test.ts\n M electron/main.mjs\n M knip.json\nD  src/App.css\n M src/App.tsx\n M src/components/Breadcrumb.tsx\n M src/components/FirstRunOverlay.tsx\nD  src/components/ItemMedia.test.ts\n M src/components/ItemMedia.tsx\n M src/components/LiquidGlass.tsx\n M src/components/SegmentedControl/SegmentedControl.tsx\n M src/components/mascot/MascotHomeSlot.tsx\n M src/components/mascot/SearchOutline.test.ts\n M src/components/mascot/alive.test.ts\nD  src/components/mascot/inklingSkins.test.ts\n M src/components/mascot/readmeMascot.test.ts\n M src/components/onboarding/MemoryMatch.tsx\n M src/features/capture/AddMenu/AddMenu.css\n M src/features/capture/AddMenu/AddMenu.tsx\n M src/features/capture/ShortcutsDialog.tsx\n M src/features/capture/useCapture.ts\n M src/features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.tsx\n M src/features/item-view/imageZoom.test.ts\n M src/features/library/LibraryCard.tsx\n M src/features/library/LibraryStage.tsx\n M src/features/library/ViewDock.tsx\n M src/features/library/libraryItem.ts\n M src/features/library/seed.ts\n M src/features/settings/ArchivePanel.tsx\n M src/features/settings/ExtensionPairing.tsx\n M src/features/settings/SettingsSheet.tsx\n M src/features/shell/Sidebar.tsx\n M src/features/shell/SpacesSection.tsx\n M src/index.css\n M src/lib/assetUrlCache.test.ts\n M src/lib/keyboardShortcuts.test.ts\n M src/lib/libraryApi.test.ts\n M src/lib/noteMarkdown.test.ts\n M src/lib/notes.test.ts\n M src/lib/previewMode.test.ts\n M src/lib/previewMode.ts\n M src/main.tsx\n M src/ui/IconButton.tsx\n M src/ui/Surface.css\n?? src/components/onboarding/onboarding.css\n?? src/features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.css\n?? src/ui/Toaster.css\n?? src/ui/Toaster.tsx\n  579 src/reader.css\n  157 src/ReaderView.tsx\n  736 total\nsrc/ReaderView.tsx:5:import \"./reader.css\";\ndocs/tech-stack.md:27:Components style themselves with Tailwind utilities against the tokens in `src/index.css`. Base UI supplies behavior and accessibility for dialogs, tabs, menus and buttons, with no theme of its own. Plain CSS files are kept only where utilities can't reach: `reader.css` and the note editor style HTML they don't render themselves, onboarding runs on keyframes, and Sonner's toasts are styled through its