{"parentUuid":"fc3a0d8f-e8ed-4f85-b2d5-89aa5c5f008d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQZgAVzh6rzpoLBeA1h1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm planning the full app script: capturing onboarding screens via screencast frame-by-frame since it's shown on fresh launch, settling each screen before taking a shot and continuing, then compiling frames into video later with ffmpeg. I'm also considering that the mascot animation might run on canvas/rAF, so standard animation-settling checks should still work fine.\n\nNext I need to simulate pasting a URL into the empty library via a clipboard paste event, then wait for the extracted card titled \"The quiet craft\" to appear. After that, I want to screenshot the library and check for the liquid-glass canvas element and any data-liquid attributes, then open the reader through the card's context menu, verify the reader view renders correctly with no inline scripts, and capture font computations before closing it with Escape. Finally, I plan to reuse the existing note-adding logic from earlier in fullapp.ts, so I should review that section along with the archive handling that follows it.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":576,"cache_read_input_tokens":99472,"output_tokens":619,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":424},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":576,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":619,"cache_read_input_tokens":99472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":576,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":576},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7740,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgQZgAAA1CngtzXkCGMDZ","requestRef":"52590dd8-4c33-476f-9e48-cf02ab060071","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8a390a31-390e-42d8-b97c-5e82e49a8428","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:52:10.732Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
