{"parentUuid":"4a222210-9cb8-4755-97ef-66e495ca7f8e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQZgov2Ri5GsR2XeupCa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm working out how to add optional screencast recording during onboarding using CDP's Page.startScreencast, but realize the existing cdp helper doesn't expose a way to listen for screencastFrame events and ack them, so I'll need to handle raw socket messages directly instead of relying on the console-only onmessage handler.\n\nThen I plan the actual onboarding play-through pacing - letting animations settle before each shot, using frame holds for extra video duration, simulating URL paste via a clipboard event, and opening the reader view through a card's context menu. For the reader check I want to verify no scripts or inline handlers, heading count, font and background styling, and that focus returns correctly after pressing Escape to close it. I also note the note-adding flow still needs to be captured with an embedded screenshot.\n\nI'm now mapping out the remaining checks: adding a note via the Edit menu with a Focus mode shot, archiving via the card context menu and confirming the Undo toast, and reporting glass-effect element counts along with a library shot. I also need to verify keyboard/focus behavior across dialogs — shortcuts dialog closing and refocusing, settings dialog tab navigation and escape handling, and card menu escape returning focus — before writing everything up.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5200,"cache_read_input_tokens":100048,"output_tokens":1149,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":733},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5200,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1149,"cache_read_input_tokens":100048,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5200,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5200},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13484,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgQZgobBfz8kAVNjFzeXz","requestRef":"cae6cdc7-16d1-4559-90a1-55fe9a88b39b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"09ed6709-499e-4ded-87f0-d4d5d442a1a3","timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:52:25.183Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
