{"parentUuid":"d105e625-6a2a-413e-bc5a-cb51dea4f2be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQacdUihXVSZTYNRScuC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Counts on main → stack tip are 2381 → 2309 comment lines and 289 → 249 test cases across 33 → 31 files in src/ and electron/. Opening the draft PR against the SQU-131 branch:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_read_input_tokens":142911,"output_tokens":2695,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":318},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2695,"cache_read_input_tokens":142911,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgQacdAch9dMB7DCC2NFM","requestRef":"a989f83b-bb93-4a33-83ca-6685c4d59f89","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"83749608-de44-43fd-a62d-6368f89e1a7f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:04:27.601Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-a1f541e8","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss","slug":"starry-painting-spark"}
{"parentUuid":"83749608-de44-43fd-a62d-6368f89e1a7f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQacdUihXVSZTYNRScuC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Joh2PWXjmAQu7aHuj7ZG25","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/squ132/body.md <<'EOF'\nLinear: [SQU-132](https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-132/stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss)\n\nLast layer of the SQU-124 UI refactor. Stacked on #181.\n\n## Problem\n\n`App.css` still held onboarding, toasts, the note editor, the library frame and a dozen one-off classes, so every feature's look was partly in a 1,900-line shared file. The docs still described Zustand, TanStack Query and tokens that don't exist. Many tests only restated types, markup or mock calls, and AGENTS.md didn't say how comments and tests should look.\n\n## Fix\n\n- **App.css is gone.** Each rule moved to its owner:\n  - onboarding keyframes and GSAP selectors → `components/onboarding/onboarding.css`, imported by `FirstRunOverlay`;\n  - Sonner toast styling → `ui/Toaster.css`, behind a small `Toaster` wrapper;\n  - TipTap note editor rules → `features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.css`, which loads with the lazy editor chunk;\n  - the library frame, breadcrumb, add button, brand mark and text button → Tailwind utilities;\n  - the focus ring, `spin` keyframes, reduced-motion override and sidebar width step → `index.css`;\n  - card accents now carry token classes (`bg-blue-soft`, …) and `visually-hidden` is `sr-only`.\n- **`reader.css`** already sat next to `ReaderView` and reads the shared tokens, so it stays put.\n- **Tests:** deleted type-redundant, smoke, static-markup and mock-mirror tests, and un-exported the helpers only they used, with no product-code change. Kept extraction, sanitizing, queues, migrations, asset paths, deep links, ordering and liquid glass.\n  - `bun test`: **324 tests / 40 files, 36.4s → 284 tests / 38 files, 40.3s.** The time is noise; the slow OCR and Electron suites are all kept.\n- **AGENTS.md:** the comment rules now live in Taste, and the test keep bar and the no-sleep/timeout/retry/poll rules in Verifying. Existing lines were rewritten, not appended.\n- **Docs:**\n  - `tech-stack.md`: the styling row was rewritten, Zustand/TanStack were replaced by the real \"hooks per feature\" row, and a new Styling section describes the liquid glass layer (WebGPU canvas, `.glass`/`.css-glass`, the CSS fallback);\n  - `design.md` tokens are now the real ones;\n  - an \"Item view\" section was added to `product-behavior.md`;\n  - the stale `expanded-item-overlay.md` spec was removed;\n  - a changelog line under Changed references SQU-124.\n- `knip.json` no longer ignores the fontsource packages (`main.tsx` imports them now). t3.json and biome.jsonc needed no change.\n\nUI files over ~600 lines, with reasons:\n- `App.tsx` (780): the composition root. Its hook order carries App()'s ordering guarantees.\n- `ItemView.tsx` (721): the GSAP flight, kept verbatim.\n- `LibraryCard.tsx` (639) and `ItemMedia.tsx` (630): one treatment per card kind.\n- `onboarding.css` (674) and `RichNoteEditor.css` (573): keyframe screens and TipTap output.\n\nMascot engines are out of scope; `storage.mjs` is split in #175.\n\n## Hit every surface\n\n- **Card types:** note and quote accents, article, image. Same pixels.\n- **Entry points:** paste URL, Add menu note, card context menu.\n- **App modes:** preview (CSS fallback) and full app (liquid glass: 2 `.glass[data-liquid]`, canvas 1280×800).\n- **Reverse states:** archive → Undo toast restores the card.\n- **Docs:** updated as above.\n- **Capture and search paths:** not touched.\n\n## Verification\n\nBase was #181's head (16610f5), compared against this branch.\n\n- **Preview**, 1280/1000/760 wide: the library, sidebar closed, shortcuts dialog, search focus, note edit and focus mode, card menu, toast, Settings, and all five onboarding screens. Computed styles were identical. The only pixel diffs were the live mascot and first-paint image timing.\n- **Full app** via verify-inkling, base and branch side by side:\n  - onboarding plays through in the same order with the same mascot rhythm;\n  - a Paul Graham article opens in the reader with 0 scripts and 0 inline handlers, pixel-identical to base;\n  - the note editor (embedded and focus), shortcuts and Settings dialogs, and the archive Undo toast were checked. The JSON reports were identical.\n- **Keyboard:**\n  - Shortcuts: focus moves to Close, and Escape returns it to Settings.\n  - Settings tabs: arrow keys move the selection, and Escape returns focus to Settings.\n  - Card menu: opens and closes.\n- **`bun run check`**, step by step: typecheck ×3, check:refs, knip, build, build:app, ingest:smoke and the extension build all pass. Known local-Windows failures:\n  - lint: 4 CRLF `.d.mts` format errors;\n  - `bun test`: the data-dir path-separator test;\n  - one run timed out the system-font scan test while two Electron instances were running. It passes alone in 0.7s.\n\n![Before (left) and after (right): library, reader, note editor, toast, onboarding](https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ132-before-after.png)\n\nOnboarding play-through (branch): https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ132-onboarding.mp4\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code (T3 Code)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --draft --base squidlee/squ-131-stack-67-item-view-overlay --title \"refactor(ui): delete App.css, prune tests, rewrite styling docs\" --body-file /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/squ132/body.md","description":"Open the SQU-132 draft PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_read_input_tokens":142911,"output_tokens":2695,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":318},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2695,"cache_read_input_tokens":142911,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Joh2PWXjmAQu7aHuj7ZG25":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-a1f541e8 && cat > /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/squ132/body.md <<'EOF'\nLinear: [SQU-132](https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-132/stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss)\n\nLast layer of the SQU-124 UI refactor. Stacked on #181.\n\n## Problem\n\n`App.css` still held onboarding, toasts, the note editor, the library frame and a dozen one-off classes, so every feature's look was partly in a 1,900-line shared file. The docs still described Zustand, TanStack Query and tokens that don't exist. Many tests only restated types, markup or mock calls, and AGENTS.md didn't say how comments and tests should look.\n\n## Fix\n\n- **App.css is gone.** Each rule moved to its owner:\n  - onboarding keyframes and GSAP selectors → `components/onboarding/onboarding.css`, imported by `FirstRunOverlay`;\n  - Sonner toast styling → `ui/Toaster.css`, behind a small `Toaster` wrapper;\n  - TipTap note editor rules → `features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.css`, which loads with the lazy editor chunk;\n  - the library frame, breadcrumb, add button, brand mark and text button → Tailwind utilities;\n  - the focus ring, `spin` keyframes, reduced-motion override and sidebar width step → `index.css`;\n  - card accents now carry token classes (`bg-blue-soft`, …) and `visually-hidden` is `sr-only`.\n- **`reader.css`** already sat next to `ReaderView` and reads the shared tokens, so it stays put.\n- **Tests:** deleted type-redundant, smoke, static-markup and mock-mirror tests, and un-exported the helpers only they used, with no product-code change. Kept extraction, sanitizing, queues, migrations, asset paths, deep links, ordering and liquid glass.\n  - `bun test`: **324 tests / 40 files, 36.4s → 284 tests / 38 files, 40.3s.** The time is noise; the slow OCR and Electron suites are all kept.\n- **AGENTS.md:** the comment rules now live in Taste, and the test keep bar and the no-sleep/timeout/retry/poll rules in Verifying. Existing lines were rewritten, not appended.\n- **Docs:**\n  - `tech-stack.md`: the styling row was rewritten, Zustand/TanStack were replaced by the real \"hooks per feature\" row, and a new Styling section describes the liquid glass layer (WebGPU canvas, `.glass`/`.css-glass`, the CSS fallback);\n  - `design.md` tokens are now the real ones;\n  - an \"Item view\" section was added to `product-behavior.md`;\n  - the stale `expanded-item-overlay.md` spec was removed;\n  - a changelog line under Changed references SQU-124.\n- `knip.json` no longer ignores the fontsource packages (`main.tsx` imports them now). t3.json and biome.jsonc needed no change.\n\nUI files over ~600 lines, with reasons:\n- `App.tsx` (780): the composition root. Its hook order carries App()'s ordering guarantees.\n- `ItemView.tsx` (721): the GSAP flight, kept verbatim.\n- `LibraryCard.tsx` (639) and `ItemMedia.tsx` (630): one treatment per card kind.\n- `onboarding.css` (674) and `RichNoteEditor.css` (573): keyframe screens and TipTap output.\n\nMascot engines are out of scope; `storage.mjs` is split in #175.\n\n## Hit every surface\n\n- **Card types:** note and quote accents, article, image. Same pixels.\n- **Entry points:** paste URL, Add menu note, card context menu.\n- **App modes:** preview (CSS fallback) and full app (liquid glass: 2 `.glass[data-liquid]`, canvas 1280×800).\n- **Reverse states:** archive → Undo toast restores the card.\n- **Docs:** updated as above.\n- **Capture and search paths:** not touched.\n\n## Verification\n\nBase was #181's head (16610f5), compared against this branch.\n\n- **Preview**, 1280/1000/760 wide: the library, sidebar closed, shortcuts dialog, search focus, note edit and focus mode, card menu, toast, Settings, and all five onboarding screens. Computed styles were identical. The only pixel diffs were the live mascot and first-paint image timing.\n- **Full app** via verify-inkling, base and branch side by side:\n  - onboarding plays through in the same order with the same mascot rhythm;\n  - a Paul Graham article opens in the reader with 0 scripts and 0 inline handlers, pixel-identical to base;\n  - the note editor (embedded and focus), shortcuts and Settings dialogs, and the archive Undo toast were checked. The JSON reports were identical.\n- **Keyboard:**\n  - Shortcuts: focus moves to Close, and Escape returns it to Settings.\n  - Settings tabs: arrow keys move the selection, and Escape returns focus to Settings.\n  - Card menu: opens and closes.\n- **`bun run check`**, step by step: typecheck ×3, check:refs, knip, build, build:app, ingest:smoke and the extension build all pass. Known local-Windows failures:\n  - lint: 4 CRLF `.d.mts` format errors;\n  - `bun test`: the data-dir path-separator test;\n  - one run timed out the system-font scan test while two Electron instances were running. It passes alone in 0.7s.\n\n![Before (left) and after (right): library, reader, note editor, toast, onboarding](https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ132-before-after.png)\n\nOnboarding play-through (branch): https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/releases/download/pr-evidence-mascot/squ132-onboarding.mp4\n\nClaude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code (T3 Code)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --draft --base squidlee/squ-131-stack