{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"75984dfb3e16b217bb8f871d9d35f77b50c3a9c3a3edbd7a56121dcadcfc41a5","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I notice SQU-132 is still marked Todo when it should be In Progress, so I need to update that status now and move it to In Review once CI passes, along with posting a progress comment. For checking CI status, I should avoid polling patterns like sleep loops or `gh pr checks --watch` since the guidance explicitly discourages those approaches.\n\nThe right move is to use watch_pull_request since marking the PR ready still depends on checks completing. Meanwhile, I'll work on the SQU-124 summary prep and cleanup tasks while that's pending, then circle back to verify CI later.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KxYvamwiShEwKteyznzz8y","name":"mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_issue","input":{"id":"SQU-132","state":"In Progress"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XXDgNGs1pQkZYZfZvxR2tN","name":"mcp__claude_ai_Linear__save_comment","input":{"issueId":"SQU-132","body":"Draft PR #182 is open, stacked on #181.\n\n- **App.css is deleted.** Each rule moved to its owner:\n  - onboarding → `components/onboarding/onboarding.css`;\n  - toasts → `ui/Toaster.css`;\n  - TipTap note editor → `features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.css`;\n  - everything else → utilities or `index.css`.\n- **reader.css** already sat next to ReaderView on the shared tokens, so it stays put.\n- **Test prune:** 324 tests / 40 files → 284 / 38. `bun test` took 36.4s → 40.3s; the change is noise, since the slow OCR and Electron suites are kept.\n- **AGENTS.md** carries the comment and test rules.\n- **Docs:** tech-stack.md and design.md are rewritten, with the liquid glass contract and the real tokens. The stale expanded-item-overlay spec is removed, and the changelog has a line for SQU-124.\n- **Verified against base (16610f5):**\n  - Preview: computed 