{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"bf5ac5c7-e575-44db-b623-8a1386058030","hash":"4c68d03078dcb97ffd900727df1928ca3cf5f2f442bc5d86b9422854b0e399b5","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KxYvamwiShEwKteyznzz8y","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"SQU-132\",\"uuid\":\"a81ffc45-26f3-4655-9883-9156b08ea3cd\",\"title\":\"Stack 7/7: onboarding, reader, cleanup, delete App.css\",\"description\":\"Part of <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Top of the stack, stacked on <issue id=\\\"5142eff8-ddbb-43a9-94f9-fb9eda73ed6e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-131/stack-67-item-view-overlay\\\">SQU-131</issue>.\\n\\n## Scope\\n\\n* Move what is left in `App.css` to its owner: onboarding keyframes and GSAP-targeted selectors next to `FirstRunOverlay` and `components/onboarding/*`, toast styling next to the Toaster, then delete `App.css`.\\n* `reader.css` stays plain CSS (it styles untrusted article HTML through descendant selectors). Move it next to `ReaderView` and point it at the shared tokens.\\n* Confirm no `src/` file is still a god file (nothing in the UI over \\\\~600 lines without a reason).\\n* Docs: rewrite `docs/tech-stack.md` so the styling row matches reality and Zustand/TanStack Query are either removed or justified; update `docs/design.md` tokens to the real ones; add a `docs/changelog.md` line under Changed referencing <issue id=\\\"21730aba-d748-4cce-a4f7-4d64d11a941e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-124/ui-rewrite-split-god-files-tailwind-base-ui-primitives\\\">SQU-124</issue>. Rewrite existing text, do not append.\\n* Update `t3.json`, `knip.json` and `biome.jsonc` if any script, entry or ignore changed.\\n\\n## Done when\\n\\n* `App.css` is gone and `bun run check` passes.\\n* Onboarding plays through unchanged, including the screen order and the mascot rhythm; reader renders sanitized article HTML as before.\\n* Final walkthrough of every surface in the full app, with a short video for any motion.\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/squidys-tools/issue/SQU-132/stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"gitBranchName\":\"squidlee/squ-132-stack-77-onboarding-reader-cleanup-delete-appcss\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-20T23:59:43.406Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T09:05:02.619Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T08:30:10.397Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"inkling-ui\",\"Refactor\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"72da6b0b-d5fb-4a51-a764-34db6cca6745\",\"title\":\"refactor(ui): delete App.css, prune tests, rewrite styling docs\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/182\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Chris\",\"createdById\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"assignee\":\"Chris\",\"assigneeId\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"project\":\"inkling\",\"projectId\":\"ac79260a-4278-4ead-bab6-73465e670bbf\",\"parentId\":\"SQU-124\",\"team\":\"Squidys Tools\",\"teamId\":\"5085a8e9-51a4-4021-9cdd-b86cad7a436c\"}"}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XXDgNGs1pQkZYZfZvxR2tN","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"6f887f2b-e623-4b5e-8f6d-1d0f9ebcc64a\",\"body\":\"Draft PR #182 is open, stacked on #181.\\n\\n- **App.css is deleted.** Each rule moved to its owner:\\n  - onboarding → `components/onboarding/onboarding.css`;\\n  - toasts → `ui/Toaster.css`;\\n  - TipTap note editor → `features/item-view/RichNoteEditor.css`;\\n  - everything else → utilities or `index.css`.\\n- **reader.css** already sat next to ReaderView on the shared tokens, so it stays put.\\n- **Test prune:** 324 tests / 40 files → 284 / 38. `bun test` took 36.4s → 40.3s; the change is noise, since the slow OCR and Electron suites are kept.\\n- **AGENTS.md** carries the comment and test rules.\\n- **Docs:** tech-stack.md and design.md are rewritten, with the liquid glass contract and the real tokens. The stale expanded-item-overlay spec is removed, and the changelog has a line for SQU-124.\\n- **Verified against base (16610f5):**\\n  - Preview: computed styles identical across 16 surfaces.\\n  - Full app via verify-inkling, base and branch side by side: same onboarding order and mascot rhythm, and the reader is pixel-identical with 0 scripts and 0 inline handlers.\\n  - Note editor, dialogs, tabs and the Undo toast match, and focus returns where it did.\\n- **Local `bun run check`:** green apart from the known Windows-only CRLF lint and path-separator test.\\n\\nI'll mark it ready once CI is green.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T09:05:03.652Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-26T09:05:03.593Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"6f0b670e-38e3-4c7c-9618-20b6410009cc\",\"name\":\"Chris\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}"}]}]}}
